  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCMP ToT / Follow up</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is to embed technical CCMP skills within the south partner organization, enabling organic growth and spread of CCMP within the church network. It is planned to strengthen and consolidate CCMP processes within partner churches governance structures. The partner will be capacitated to implement CCMP within the church network and communities will be mobilized. 15 ToT will be educated and the project will impact 6.640 +.</narrative>
  </description>
